## Why this suite is legitimately RED before implementation

`test/task-sheet.test.ts` fails to load — `Cannot find module
'../src/shared/task-sheet'` — because the module is created by plan Task 1.
For a brand-new pure module that is the only red available; what carries
the discrimination once it exists is the content of the assertions above
(restore-not-reseed on `open`, drafts kept on `close`, only that Task's
draft dropped on `saved` / `deleted`, same-object no-ops). The other 289
cases of the corpus stay green.

No test asserts on an invented internal, a private field or a call count.
No mock: the reducer is pure, so the tests hand it the events the screen
would dispatch.

